#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1461 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "LBBODSYS populated, LBBDSYCD blank -> would fire if in scope. Scope.Domains.Include [AE, CE, MH] rejects LB -> skipped. ONE pin of the SDTM single-list domain-include gate for this batch (SD2288's identical mechanism deliberately gets no copy)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBSEQ    type=Num
col LBBODSYS type=Char
col LBBDSYCD type=Num
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | INFECTIONS | .
